[Term]
id: DOID:4
name: disease
def: "A disease is a disposition to undergo pathological processes that exists in an organism because of one or more disorders in that organism." [url:http\://dictionary.reference.com/browse/disease, url:https\://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disease]
